Name: drafting
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-08-18
Author: Andreas Bertsatos
Maintainer: Andreas Bertsatos <abertsatos@biol.uoa.gr>
Title: Geometry, CAD Input/Output and Technical Drawing
Description: Planar geometry primitives, ASCII DXF reading and writing,
 and a format-agnostic technical drawing model with DXF and TikZ backends.
 Solid modelling with STEP and STL through Open CASCADE, when the package
 is built with it.  Provides the drafting layer for engineering design
 packages.
Categories: Graphics
Depends: octave (>= 11.1.0)
SystemRequirements: Open CASCADE (>= 7.8.0), optional, for solid modelling
Url: https://github.com/pr0m1th3as/drafting
Tracker: https://github.com/pr0m1th3as/drafting/issues
